// Title: Writing Local Admin Share
// Sigma ID: 4aafb0fa-bff5-4b9d-b99e-8093e659c65f
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-01-01 | Modified: 2022-08-13
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, persistence, lateral-movement, T1546.002
// Description: Aversaries may use to interact with a remote network share using Server Message Block (SMB).
//   This technique is used by post-exploitation frameworks.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1021.002/T1021.002.md#atomic-test-4---execute-command-writing-output-to-local-admin-share
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_writing_local_admin_share.yml
